      "subtitle": "Create, validate, invalidate, and remove a standard CloudFront distribution",
      "description": "A short, intermediate CloudFront learner journey using an Amazon S3 origin in eu-west-2. The Console path creates a standard distribution with the recommended Amazon S3 origin settings, including origin access control (OAC). The separate CLI commands demonstrate the corresponding CloudFront and S3 operations, but the CLI distribution-creation command does not configure OAC because completing that secure CLI configuration would require an S3 bucket policy, which this follow along intentionally does not provide.",
